title: "Discrete Relational Network Dynamics (DRND): A Fully Emergent Framework for Spacetime, Matter, and the Evolution of Fundamental Constants"
type: report
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-02-11
authors:
  - family-names: "Kłeczek"
    given-names: "Robert"
    email: "r.kleczek@advocem.com"
